**Authentication Best Practices:**

| Practice | Why | How |
|----------|-----|-----|
| **Centralize token management** | Avoid repetition | TokenManager singleton |
| **Handle token refresh** | Reliability | Automatic refresh on expiry |
| **Test auth failures** | Security | Test 401, 403 scenarios |
| **Different roles** | Authorization | Test with admin, user, guest |
| **Secrets in config** | Security | Never hardcode credentials |

**Key Insight:** Authentication is often the most complex part of API testing. Centralize it, automate it, and test both success and failure scenarios thoroughly.

