**Key Insight:** A well-structured framework makes testing scalable and maintainable. The investment in building a robust foundation pays off every time you add a new test or debug a failure. This framework gives you:
- **Reusability**: Write once, use everywhere
- **Consistency**: All tests follow the same patterns
- **Maintainability**: Change one place, update all tests
- **Reporting**: Clear visibility into test results
- **Extensibility**: Easy to add new features

