**Stubbing Basics**

```java
// Stub for exact URL
stubFor(get(urlEqualTo("/users/1"))
    .willReturn(aResponse()
        .withStatus(200)
        .withBody("response")));

// Stub with URL pattern
stubFor(get(urlPathMatching("/users/\\d+"))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(200)));

// Stub with query parameters
stubFor(get(urlPathEqualTo("/users"))
    .withQueryParam("page", equalTo("2"))
    .withQueryParam("limit", matching("[0-9]+"))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(200)));

// Stub with headers
stubFor(post("/users")
    .withHeader("Content-Type", equalTo("application/json"))
    .withHeader("Authorization", containing("Bearer"))
    .willReturn(aResponse()
        .withStatus(201)
        .withHeader("Location", "/users/123")));
```

**Request Body Matching**

```java
// Exact body match
stubFor(post("/users")
    .withRequestBody(equalToJson("{\"name\":\"John\"}"))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(201)));

// JSON path matching
stubFor(post("/users")
    .withRequestBody(matchingJsonPath("$.name"))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(201)));

// JSON path with value check
stubFor(post("/users")
    .withRequestBody(matchingJsonPath("$.age", equalTo("30")))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(201)));

// XML body matching
stubFor(post("/users")
    .withRequestBody(equalToXml("<user><name>John</name></user>"))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(201)));

// XPath matching
stubFor(post("/users")
    .withRequestBody(matchingXPath("/user/name/text()"))
    .willReturn(aResponse().withStatus(201)));
```

**Advanced Response Configuration**

```java
// Response with delay (simulate slow API)
stubFor(get("/slow")
    .willReturn(aResponse()
        .withStatus(200)
        .withFixedDelay(2000)));  // 2 second delay

// Response with random delay
stubFor(get("/variable")
    .willReturn(aResponse()
        .withStatus(200)
        .withRandomDelay(new UniformDistribution(100, 500))));

// Response with fault (simulate network errors)
stubFor(get("/fault")
    .willReturn(aResponse()
        .withFault(Fault.CONNECTION_RESET_BY_PEER)));

// Response with chunked encoding
stubFor(get("/chunked")
    .willReturn(aResponse()
        .withStatus(200)
        .withChunkedDribbleDelay(10, 1000)));  // 10 chunks, 1 sec between
```

**Response Templating**

```java
